  - text: welcome you to the council meeting
    npcId: voices
  - text: we are people who having voting right for the guild master seat.
    npcId: voices
  - text: 'The big 3: Admin Vex, Sergent Ilda, and Guard''s head Blackwood.'
    npcId: voices
  - text: Each of them will have two votes count. While the rest of us each one have
